  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Nitrogen oxides in air</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Eutrophication</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Methane in air</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">II</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math>&nbsp;of rain water becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Carbon dioxide</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">III</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Global warming</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Phosphate fertilisers in water</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IV</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Acid rain</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given&nbsp;below :</p>"
  },
